      "message": "It\u0027s debatable. But think of the case where a slot has no SIM in it. There\u0027s no card but we still know that any card in that slot is going to be removable; in that sense it really is a property of the slot. How/where we expose it is different. We can expose it as part of the card if that is more desirable from an API perspective.",
